        "created_at": "2016-04-06T01:39:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>All the rules text is written on the cards; you could play with a lookup table, but that would be slower and less engaging. And less pretty. And would require Peter to send you a table of all the card text.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was away from my SotM game for a month and I actually did this. Wasn't half as fun though.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
